		{
			dependencies: ["513DE71C2CA3DFF7"]
			description: [
				"Every now and then while you are underground, one of these diminutive cave dwellers will approach to see if you have any tasty turtle eggies, building materials, or ore on hand.  "
				""
				"They can use their magic tiny people powers to make more ingots than you can out of those raw ores, and somehow have access to superior enchantments.  Those enchantments are pretty pricey though, and you'll never know which tools their wierd little shamans spiffed up and are sending to market."
