		{
			dependencies: ["364209FA865BA98E"]
			description: [
				"Deep in the bowels of The Nether, beneath oceans of molten stone and strange geology, you have discovered a metallic substance dispersed throughout the lowest strata.  It can only be described as malfeasantly malleable and your knowledge of metallurgy and smithcraft lead you to believe an alloy with gold may just yield a new material with incredible properties."
				""
				"In your travels through this Realm, you've come across remnants of a civilation of porcine humanoids.  Their towering blackstone structures, now in ruins, are still inhabited by their now-defunct culture.  In their old ruins you've discovered templates that describe a process that allows tools and armor to be coated with a potent and highly pliable substance that offers complete immunity to heat and immense attribute reinforcement."
			]
